     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.RunQAChecks</b></p><a name=\"SGAuthoring.Skills.RunQAChecks\"> </a><a name=\"hcSGAuthoring.Skills.RunQAChecks\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the actor <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.QCReviewer.html\">Quality Control Reviewer</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"QA-01\"> </a></b>Run IG Publisher QA</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can run the FHIR IG Publisher and locate the generated qa.html report.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"QA-02\"> </a></b>Interpret QA errors and warnings</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can interpret QA validation errors, warnings, and information messages to identify issues requiring resolution.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"QA-03\"> </a></b>Triage suppressions</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can assess whether warnings can be legitimately suppressed with reasonable explanation, and document suppressions.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"QA-04\"> </a></b>Verify zero-error status</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can verify that the QA report shows no errors or unsuppressed warnings before publication.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.RunQAChecks</b></p><a name=\"fr-SGAuthoring.Skills.RunQAChecks\"> </a><a name=\"fr-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.RunQAChecks\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profil: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>Ces exigences s'appliquent à l'acteur <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.QCReviewer.html\">Quality Control Reviewer</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-QA-01\"> </a></b>Run IG Publisher QA</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can run the FHIR IG Publisher and locate the generated qa.html report.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-QA-02\"> </a></b>Interpret QA errors and warnings</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can interpret QA validation errors, warnings, and information messages to identify issues requiring resolution.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-QA-03\"> </a></b>Triage suppressions</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can assess whether warnings can be legitimately suppressed with reasonable explanation, and document suppressions.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-QA-04\"> </a></b>Verify zero-error status</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can verify that the QA report shows no errors or unsuppressed warnings before publication.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><hr/><p><b>Arabic</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>السرد المُنشأ: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.RunQAChecks</b></p><a name=\"ar-SGAuthoring.Skills.RunQAChecks\"> </a><a name=\"ar-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.RunQAChecks\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">الملف الشخصي: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>تنطبق هذه المتطلبات على الممثل <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.QCReviewer.html\">Quality Control Reviewer</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-QA-01\"> </a></b>Run IG Publisher QA</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can run the FHIR IG Publisher and locate the generated qa.html report.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-QA-02\"> </a></b>Interpret QA errors and warnings</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can interpret QA validation errors, warnings, and information messages to identify issues requiring resolution.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-QA-03\"> </a></b>Triage suppressions</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can assess whether warnings can be legitimately suppressed with reasonable explanation, and document suppressions.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-QA-04\"> </a></b>Verify zero-error status</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can verify that the QA report shows no errors or unsuppressed warnings before publication.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\"><hr/><p><b>Chinese</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.RunQAChecks</b></p><a name=\"zh-SGAuthoring.Skills.RunQAChecks\"> </a><a name=\"zh-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.RunQAChecks\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the actor <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.QCReviewer.html\">Quality Control Reviewer</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"zh-QA-01\"> </a></b>Run IG Publisher QA</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can run the FHIR IG Publisher and locate the generated qa.html report.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"zh-QA-02\"> </a></b>Interpret QA errors and warnings</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can interpret QA validation errors, warnings, and information messages to identify issues requiring resolution.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"zh-QA-03\"> </a></b>Triage suppressions</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.ht